This plugin contains the uv, uniprot_database, pubmed_database,
chembl_database and ensembl_database skills of
https://github.com/google-deepmind/science-skills at commit
4de6786171f1479026da5d3a00f110703c8ba35e, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE), modified as described in MODIFICATIONS.md.

The skills query UniProt, NCBI PubMed (E-utilities), ChEMBL and Ensembl,
which have their own terms (see each SKILL.md and SKILL_LICENSES.md
upstream). Their scripts install polite-http (MIT) and python-dotenv
(BSD-3-Clause) from PyPI at run time.
